{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future that seems perfectly optimized,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there\u2019s no need to worry about food, housing, or employment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company provides everything \u2014 and expects everything in return.Work has been gamified: complete tasks, earn points, unlock titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is orderly, uneventful, and quietly consuming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until one day, a strange popup interrupts the routine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Are you truly happy?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An invitation from a group calling itself the <i>Work Life Balance Fellowship</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, something begins to unravel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A dystopian RPG that questions the meaning of \u201chappiness\u201d in a corporate system where life is just another task</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Explore and interact with others to uncover buried truths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Evade surveillance and sneak away from your workstation in subtle stealth segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Organize clues and navigate logic in the <strong>Maze of Thought</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Confront opposing views and argue your way forward in the<strong> Maze of Debate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Will you conform to the system\u2014or seek a freedom no one promised?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the story\u2019s outcome.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Food Over Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736550/436f30551e78be9cdac2e898b7a1c079d3e18978.jpg"},{"name":"Supreme Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/